The <Inspired> group show of fall 2024 is presenting Kim Min Kyeong, Kim Soo Jung, Ley, Lyu Marina, and Sylvia Rojas. 

The five artists each found the way they exist in this world. In their art, they tell an autobiographical story of hardship, acceptance, overcoming and insight as a reflection of their own past, present, and future with a full heart. 

We hope you are able to join their chapter of consolation, courage, and hope.

